LDERS OF RECORD ON AUGUST 26, 2021."}{'symbol': 'SPG', 'date': '2021-06-22 09:15:00-04:56', 'title': 'Simon Property Group Announces 7.7 Percent Increase in Second Quarter 2021 Dividend', 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, JUNE 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SIMON, A GLOBAL LEADER IN THE OWNERSHIP OF PREMIER SHOPPING, DINING, ENTERTAINMENT AND MIXED-USE DESTINATIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED A 7.7% INCREASE IN ITS COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND FOR THE SECOND QUARTER 2021.\xa0 SIMON'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A $1.40 PER COMMON SHARE DIVIDEND, PAYABLE IN CASH, FOR THE SECOND QUARTER 2021."}{'symbol': 'SWK', 'date': '2021-06-22 19:47:00-04:56', 'title': 'Stanley Black & Decker President and CFO Don Allan To Provide Testimony Before Senate Finance Committee on International Trade, Customs and Global Competitiveness on June 22', 'text': "WASHINGTON, JUNE 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- STANLEY BLACK & DECKER (NYSE:SWK) PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER DON ALLAN WILL TESTIFY BEFORE SENATE FINANCE COMMITTEE, SUBCOMMITTEE ON INTERNATIONAL TRADE, CUSTOMS AND GLOBAL COMPETITIVENESS ON JUNE 22. ALLAN WILL PROVIDE TESTIMONY ON BEHALF OF STANLEY BLACK & DECKER ON THE COMPANY'S MANUFACTURING AND SUPPLY CHAIN RESILIENCY AND DISCUSS THE IMPORTANCE OF MANUFACTURING IN THE UNITED STATES."}{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2021-06-22 09:05:00-04:56', 'title': 'Synopsys to Acquire Semiconductor and Flat Panel Display Solutions from BISTel', 'text': 'MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF., JUNE 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SYNOPSYS, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: SNPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS SIGNED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE THE SEMICONDUCTOR AND FLAT PANEL DISPLAY SOLUTIONS FROM BISTEL, A LEADER IN ENGINEERING EQUIPMENT SYSTEMS AND AI APPLICATIONS FOR SEMICONDUCTOR SMART MANUFACTURING, HEADQUARTERED IN SOUTH KOREA.'}{'symbol': 'TRV', 'date': '2021-06-22 09:17:00-04:56', 'title': 'Travelers Announces the Start of the 2021 Travelers Championship', 'text': "HARTFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE TRAVELERS COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE: TRV) TODAY A